  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a sequence of integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ and an integer MMM.\n\nFor any valid integers p,qp, qp,q, let's define F(p,q)F(p, q)F(p,q) as the dot product of the subsequences Ap,Ap+1,…,Ap+M−1A_p, A_{p+1}, \\ldots, A_{p+M-1}Ap​,Ap+1​,…,Ap+M−1​ and Aq,Aq+1,…,Aq+M−1A_q, A_{q+1}, \\ldots, A_{q+M-1}Aq​,Aq+1​,…,Aq+M−1​, i.e. F(p,q)=∑i=0M−1Ap+i⋅Aq+iF(p, q) = \\sum_{i=0}^{M-1} A_{p+i} \\cdot A_{q+i}F(p,q)=∑i=0M−1​Ap+i​⋅Aq+i​.\n\nYou should process QQQ queries. In each query:\n\n\nYou are given two integers pospospos and valvalval. Change the value of AposA_{pos}Apos​ to valvalval.\nThen, find the sum S=∑i=1N−M+1∑j=1N−M+1F(i,j)S = \\sum_{i=1}^{N-M+1} \\sum_{j=1}^{N-M+1}F(i, j)S=∑i=1N−M+1​∑j=1N−M+1​F(i,j). Since this sum could be very large, compute it modulo 998,244,353998,244,353998,244,353.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1001 \\le T \\le 1001≤T≤100",
      "1≤M≤N≤5⋅1051 \\le M \\le N \\le 5 \\cdot 10^51≤M≤N≤5⋅105",
      "1≤Ai≤5⋅1051 \\le A_i \\le 5 \\cdot 10^51≤Ai​≤5⋅105 for each valid iii",
      "1≤Q≤5⋅1051 \\le Q \\le 5 \\cdot 10^51≤Q≤5⋅105",
      "1≤pos≤N1 \\le pos \\le N1≤pos≤N",
      "1≤val≤5⋅1051 \\le \\left.\\right. val \\le 5 \\cdot 10^51≤val≤5⋅105",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 10610^6106",
      "the sum of QQQ over all test cases does not exceed 10610^6106",
      "Subtasks**Subtask #1 (50 points):** Q=1Q = 1Q=1"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains three space-separated integers NNN, MMM and QQQ.\nThe second line of each test case contains NNN space-separated integers representing A1,A2,...ANA_1,A_2,...A_NA1​,A2​,...AN​.\nQQQ lines follow. Each of these lines contains two space-separated integers pospospos and valvalval describing a query.",
    "outputFormat": "For each query, print a single line containing one integer SSS modulo 998,244,353998,244,353998,244,353.",
